{"_id":"68a736138ec3d8323af14e46","nodeId":"KYUh29Ok1aeOviboGDS_i","roadmapSlug":"data-engineer","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:58.672Z","description":"# Memcached\n\nMemcached is a high-performance, distributed in-memory caching system. It is simpler than Redis, supporting only key-value string storage, but is very fast and horizontally scalable. Memcached is commonly used to cache database query results and reduce load on backend systems.","resources":[{"type":"opensource","title":"memcached","url":"https://github.com/memcached/memcached#readme","_id":"6a7f4a42cb44947debcf5294"},{"type":"article","title":"Memcached Tutorial","url":"https://www.tutorialspoint.com/memcached/index.htm","_id":"6a7f4a42cb44947debcf5295"},{"type":"video","title":"Redis vs Memcached","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Gyy1SiE8avE","_id":"6a7f4a42cb44947debcf5296"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:02:58.294Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04e1fb5fcb94d0417044","title":"DataCamp - Associate Data Engineer in SQL","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/WOP6XG"},{"_id":"6a5e04e1fb5fcb94d0417100","title":"DataCamp - Data Engineer in Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/JkYLbr"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/data-engineer/content/KYUh29Ok1aeOviboGDS_i.md"}